  "changelog": "Initial release.\n\n- Provides read-only querying of Huawei Cloud IAM resources using local Python scripts (via Python SDK).\n- Supports querying users, groups, policies, agencies, AK/SK, MFA devices, login/password/ACL policies, security compliance, and account quotas.\n- No support for create, modify, or delete operations; strictly query-only.\n- All operations are executed via packaged scripts, not direct CLI, API, or script editing.\n- Detailed usage and script references included in guide files under the references directory.\n- Includes robust environment checks and requires environment setup prior to use.\n- Obsolete or unused documentation file skill-card.md has been removed.",
